  "name": "Florida Citizens Roof Inspection (RCF-1 03 25)",
  "description": "Citizens Property Insurance Corporation's Roof Inspection Form, revision RCF-1 03 25. Its sections, its questions and their wording are Citizens', read off the published form -- not an approximation of it. One of its 36 blanks is left unbound on purpose; fl-citizens-roof-rcf-1.gaps.md says which and why.",
