        "items": [
          {
            "id": "roof_predominant",
            "label": "Predominant Roof",
            "type": "photo_only",
            "description": "The left-hand column on the form. Photos of each roof slope showing the roof’s condition must be submitted with this form. The form asks for every damage sign that applies and this screen takes every one you tick. Anything answered Unsatisfactory or Yes still has to be explained under Additional Comments/Observations, which is where the form itself sends an explanation. The printed blanks are narrow: write a date as MM/DD/YY and keep the covering material short, or the form refuses rather than printing over the row beneath it.",
